{"date":"2007-09-03","platform":"TV","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/df/f8/26225_4Lmvy.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/df/f8/26225_4Lmvy.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/df/f8/26225_4Lmvy.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/df/f8/26225_4Lmvy.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/df/f8/26225_4Lmvy.jpg"},"summary":"　　这部英国黏土动画曾赢得国际艾美奖。故事主要讲述一只小绵羊和伙伴们在牧场的生活故事。它们不是那种兢兢业业吃草长毛的乖乖羊，而是调皮捣蛋又活泼好动的棉花糖，生活充满了快乐生趣。有时运动运动，或者和一墙之隔的三只小猪较劲，它们兴趣广泛，拿卷心菜当足球踢，自发水彩画课程，集体泡澡等等等等。羊儿们常用些异想天开的主意，搞笑可爱的故事就这样发生了一个又一个……\r\n　　目前第三季又回来了，同样是在CBBC播出。虽说这部剧是在BBC儿童频道播出的，但大人们也会喜欢这样可爱的人物造型与诙谐幽默的剧情吧。仅仅是短短的7分钟，就能让心情愉快一整天。","name":"Shaun the Sheep Season 2","name_cn":"小羊肖恩 第二季","tags":[{"name":"欧美","count":24,"total_count":86196},{"name":"粘土动画","count":19,"total_count":184},{"name":"TV","count":14,"total_count":1391470},{"name":"2007","count":11,"total_count":37334},{"name":"小羊肖恩","count":10,"total_count":129},{"name":"童年","count":9,"total_count":92573},{"name":"搞笑","count":9,"total_count":632918},{"name":"定格动画","count":7,"total_count":3212},{"name":"Aardman_Animations","count":7,"total_count":30},{"name":"动画","count":3,"total_count":35478},{"name":"剧集","count":3,"total_count":4319},{"name":"Ltd.","count":2,"total_count":14},{"name":"非日漫","count":1,"total_count":291},{"name":"原创","count":1,"total_count":614424},{"name":"Aardman","count":1,"total_count":45}],"infobox":[{"key":"中文名","value":"小羊肖恩 第二季"},{"key":"别名","value":[{"v":"笑笑羊 第二季"},{"v":"超级无敌羊咩咩 第二季"}]},{"key":"话数","value":"20"},{"key":"放送开始","value":"2007年9月3日"},{"key":"官方网站","value":"http://www.shaunthesheep.com/"}],"rating":{"rank":2882,"total":59,"count":{"1":3,"2":0,"3":0,"4":0,"5":4,"6":12,"7":17,"8":19,"9":3,"10":1},"score":6.8},"total_episodes":20,"collection":{"on_hold":2,"dropped":12,"wish":11,"collect":145,"doing":3},"id":26225,"eps":20,"meta_tags":["TV","欧美"],"volumes":0,"series":false,"locked":false,"nsfw":false,"type":2}